      "parameters": {
        "content": "## ⚡ Google Maps Reviews Tracker: Check Removed & Edited Reviews — Automated n8n Pipeline\n**Powered by [UnitBytes on Apify](https://apify.com/unitbytes/google-maps-reviews-tracker?fpr=939u3w&fp_sid=n8n_io)** ($0.0015 / item)\n\n### ⚙️ How It Works\nThis workflow runs on a schedule, calls the **[google-maps-reviews-tracker Apify Actor](https://apify.com/unitbytes/google-maps-reviews-tracker?fpr=939u3w&fp_sid=n8n_io)** via its synchronous REST endpoint, normalizes the extracted fields (`input_url, resolved_url, status, is_active, is_removed`), and exports a clean CSV file.\n\n### 🚀 30-Second Setup Instructions\n1. **Get your free Apify API Token**: Open [google-maps-reviews-tracker on Apify Store](https://apify.com/unitbytes/google-maps-reviews-tracker?fpr=939u3w&fp_sid=n8n_io) and copy your API token from **Settings → Integrations**.\n2. **Paste your token & search parameters**: Double-click the **\"1. Set Apify Token & Input\"** node and replace `YOUR_APIFY_API_TOKEN` with your token.\n3. **Click \"Test Workflow\"**: The HTTP Request node calls the synchronous UnitBytes Apify endpoint, normalizes the extracted records, and exports a clean CSV file ready for Google Sheets, Airtable, Slack, or OpenAI.\n\n📖 **Documentation & Schema Reference**: [https://unitbytes.com/actors/google-maps-reviews-tracker/](https://unitbytes.com/actors/google-maps-reviews-tracker/)",
        "height": 380,
        "width": 520,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "77e63e08-ad5b-5ff6-809c-916c79d9738b",
      "name": "Sticky Note — Setup Guide",
